{"assets":[],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"1730","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"D. Prefixes and Suffixes"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"1 second"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"You have two strings $$$s_1$$$ and $$$s_2$$$ of length $$$n$$$, consisting of lowercase English letters. You can perform the following operation any (possibly zero) number of times: "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"attrs":{"ordered":false},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" Choose a positive integer $$$1 \\leq k \\leq n$$$. "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" Swap the prefix of the string $$$s_1$$$ and the suffix of the string $$$s_2$$$ of length $$$k$$$. "}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Is it possible to make these two strings equal by doing described operations?"}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line contains a single integer $$$t$$$ ($$$1 \\le t \\le 10^4$$$) — the number of test cases. Then the test cases follow."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Each test case consists of three lines."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line contains a single integer $$$n$$$ ($$$1 \\le n \\le 10^5$$$) — the length of the strings $$$s_1$$$ and $$$s_2$$$. "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The second line contains the string $$$s_1$$$ of length $$$n$$$, consisting of lowercase English letters."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The third line contains the string $$$s_2$$$ of length $$$n$$$, consisting of lowercase English letters."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"It is guaranteed that the sum of $$$n$$$ for all test cases does not exceed $$$2 \\cdot 10^5$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"For each test case, print \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"YES"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" if it is possible to make the strings equal, and \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"NO"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" otherwise."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Example"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n7\n3\ncbc\naba\n5\nabcaa\ncbabb\n5\nabcaa\ncbabz\n1\na\na\n1\na\nb\n6\nabadaa\nadaaba\n8\nabcabdaa\nadabcaba\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\nYES\nYES\nNO\nYES\nNO\nNO\nYES\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"note"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Note"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the first test case:"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"attrs":{"ordered":false},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" Initially $$$s_1 = \\mathtt{cbc}$$$, $$$s_2 = \\mathtt{aba}$$$. "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" Operation with $$$k = 1$$$, after the operation $$$s_1 = \\mathtt{abc}$$$, $$$s_2 = \\mathtt{abc}$$$. "}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the second test case:"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"attrs":{"ordered":false},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" Initially $$$s_1 = \\mathtt{abcaa}$$$, $$$s_2 = \\mathtt{cbabb}$$$. "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" Operation with $$$k = 2$$$, after the operation $$$s_1 = \\mathtt{bbcaa}$$$, $$$s_2 = \\mathtt{cbaab}$$$. "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" Operation with $$$k = 3$$$, after the operation $$$s_1 = \\mathtt{aabaa}$$$, $$$s_2 = \\mathtt{cbbbc}$$$. "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" Operation with $$$k = 1$$$, after the operation $$$s_1 = \\mathtt{cabaa}$$$, $$$s_2 = \\mathtt{cbbba}$$$. "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" Operation with $$$k = 2$$$, after the operation $$$s_1 = \\mathtt{babaa}$$$, $$$s_2 = \\mathtt{cbbca}$$$. "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" Operation with $$$k = 1$$$, after the operation $$$s_1 = \\mathtt{aabaa}$$$, $$$s_2 = \\mathtt{cbbcb}$$$. "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" Operation with $$$k = 2$$$, after the operation $$$s_1 = \\mathtt{cbbaa}$$$, $$$s_2 = \\mathtt{cbbaa}$$$. "}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the third test case, it's impossible to make strings equal."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"D","problemCode":"1730D","schema":2,"sourceKind":"html","sourceUrl":"https://codeforces.com/contest/1730/problem/D"}